---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="wrap section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <SectionHeading id="about">About</SectionHeading>

  <div class="prose" data-reveal>
    <p>I’m pursuing my M.S. in Data Science, Analytics and Engineering at Arizona State University, after studying AI and Machine Learning at Anurag University in Hyderabad.</p>
    <p class="pull">I’m most interested in the point where an AI model becomes something someone can actually use.</p>
    <p>That’s what draws me to work like Zoom Lens: taking an idea from the model to the interface, and solving the engineering problems in between. I enjoy building the whole system, testing its limits, and being clear about what still needs work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: var(--width-prose);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .pull {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .prose { max-width: 65ch; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.75; gap: var(--space-5); }
  .pull { font-weight: 500; margin-top: var(--space-2); }

</style>
